'''Frostsaber''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it for 5,000 [[Snowflake Tokens (2017)|Snowflake Tokens]] {{Currency|Snowflake Token 2017}} through Santa’s Workshop during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Frostsaber has a gray blade with mini teal gems on it. Its guard is a thin line with mini ice crystals at the end of both sides. It also has these mini blue circles on the guard with a thin navy blue handle.

==Trivia==
*Its model derives from the now offsale Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/1213388821/Freezing-Elfs-Ice-Sword Freezing Elf's Ice Sword], the sword that came with the [https://www.roblox.com/bundles/27/Freezing-Elf Freezing Elf] bundle.
*This and [[Snowflake]] were the only godlies available in the shop in during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]].
*When salvaged in the crafting station, it provides 11 godly [[Shards|shards]].

